# P18b CubeGrid: every Push/Pull is its own undo step INSIDE the tool (UE CubeGridTool EmitChangeAndUpdate);
# Undo steps back one push and the tool stays open; Accept still records the piece as one step.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.5,-0.6,0.6
Дано run CubeGrid "CubeGrid tool"
Дано run CubeGrid "Aim at the viewport centre: on"
Дано run CubeGrid "Grid Power 5"
Когда run CubeGrid "Select 1x1 blocks at the aim"
Когда run CubeGrid "Push/Pull out (E)"
Когда run CubeGrid "Push/Pull out (E)"
Когда run CubeGrid "Push/Pull out (E)"
Когда state
Тогда 0_three a 300 cm column (three 100 cm blocks) stands where the viewport centre aims; tool bar "Grid Power 5 - 100 cm"
Когда run Action Undo
Когда state
Тогда 1_undo1 the column is 200 cm (two blocks); the CubeGrid tool bar is still shown (tool active)
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда state
Тогда 2_undo3 no block on the grid; the CubeGrid tool bar and grid are still shown (tool active)
Когда run Action Redo
Когда state
Тогда 3_redo one 100 cm block stands where the column was; tool still active
